{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674448",
      "title": "Styling Pages & Understanding the Root Route",
      "lectureOrder": 16,
      "videoOrder": 12,
      "sourceHash": "e522e06903937b7e6486de3467ef8e23748115fab971db1fa6b6ccfba3a23baf",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "Now since it's quite ugly though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 7.92,
          "en": "as a next step, I wanna add some styling to these pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "And how do we add styling in Remix apps?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "Well, you get various options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "You can, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "use popular CSS libraries like Tailwind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 22.38,
          "en": "And you actually find a guide on using Tailwind with Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.38,
          "end": 25.56,
          "en": "on the official Remix documentation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.56,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "In that documentation article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "to which you also find a link attached to this video,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "you also learn more about various styling options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 35.04,
          "en": "But of course, I'll also go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.04,
          "end": 37.65,
          "en": "the most important styling options together with you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.65,
          "end": 39.72,
          "en": "over the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.72,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "And for this course, I'll stick to Vanilla CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "though no worries, you don't have to write the CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 49.38,
          "en": "I will provide it to you, but I'm doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.38,
          "end": 51.63,
          "en": "so that we don't have some extra dependency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.63,
          "end": 53.351,
          "en": "on some totally independent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.351,
          "end": 56.85,
          "en": "and not Remix related CSS library.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 59.25,
          "en": "Now to get started, attached to this lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.25,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "you find a main.css file, which contains some styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 64.98,
          "en": "I wanna apply to this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.98,
          "end": 67.5,
          "en": "But where should this file be stored?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.5,
          "end": 70.26,
          "en": "Well, it generally is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.26,
          "end": 73.05,
          "en": "but I prefer to create a new folder in the app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.05,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "which I named Styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.67,
          "end": 78.84,
          "en": "Though, unlike routes, Styles is not a reserved name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 81.24,
          "en": "The routes folder must be named routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.24,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "because Remix will look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "for route files in that routes folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "But the Styles folder does not have to be named Styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 90.57,
          "en": "because we will manually point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.57,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "at the style files we add there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "So therefore, you can put the main.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "which you find attached to this lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 100.68299999999999,
          "en": "into this styles folder so that it's in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "Now, in that main.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "I'm defining some CSS variables,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "some colors which I'm basically using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 111.39,
          "en": "and then I'm setting up some fonts, some background colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.39,
          "end": 114.24000000000001,
          "en": "and some styles for example for domain and navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.24000000000001,
          "end": 115.35300000000001,
          "en": "which we'll add soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.19,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "So some styles which will be used throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 125,
          "en": "And if you add this file and you reload, nothing changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "Well, because as I just mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "Remix does not automatically look for such a styles folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "It doesn't expect a styles folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 134.7,
          "en": "This name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.7,
          "end": 137.64,
          "en": "If you have some styles that should be applied to your page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.64,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "you have to tell Remix about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 143.28,
          "en": "And you do tell Remix about styles you wanna apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.28,
          "end": 146.61,
          "en": "by adding special functions to your route files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "Here main.css actually contains some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 151.77,
          "en": "that will affect all my pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.77,
          "end": 153.24,
          "en": "and therefore instead of adding it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.24,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "to all my route files separately,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 157.5,
          "en": "which would be a lot of redundant work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.5,
          "end": 160.68,
          "en": "I'll add it to this root.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 160.68,
          "end": 164.13,
          "en": "I mentioned before that root.jsx defines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.13,
          "end": 166.359,
          "en": "basically the main skeleton that will be wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.359,
          "end": 169.26,
          "en": "around all your page components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 169.26,
          "end": 171.78,
          "en": "To be precise, your page components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 175.07999999999998,
          "en": "like this markup returned by Notes Page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.07999999999998,
          "end": 178.59,
          "en": "will be injected in this outlet place here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.59,
          "end": 182.85,
          "en": "So this outlet marker here in this root skeleton",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.85,
          "end": 185.7,
          "en": "will be replaced with the actual content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 187.86,
          "en": "returned by your page components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187.86,
          "end": 189.333,
          "en": "That's how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.38,
          "end": 192.72,
          "en": "So this is the root page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 192.72,
          "end": 195.93,
          "en": "the root component that wraps all my other page components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 195.93,
          "end": 198.047,
          "en": "And therefore, in this root.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 198.047,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "we can can export a special function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 200.88,
          "end": 203.61,
          "en": "and we must export a special function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 203.61,
          "end": 206.55,
          "en": "And that function should be called links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 206.55,
          "end": 208.26,
          "en": "Now that's a reserved name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 208.26,
          "end": 212.85,
          "en": "Remix will be looking for a exported function called links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.85,
          "end": 216.27,
          "en": "It looks for such a function in all your route files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.27,
          "end": 220.68,
          "en": "and the root file, the root.jsx file counts as a route file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 220.68,
          "end": 223.89,
          "en": "This is your root route that wraps all other routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 223.89,
          "end": 225.27,
          "en": "so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 228.09,
          "en": "Now you don't have to export a links function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 228.09,
          "end": 231.24,
          "en": "Remix works without it as well as you saw before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 233.04,
          "en": "But you do need this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 233.04,
          "end": 236.28,
          "en": "if you wanna add some extra links that should be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 236.28,
          "end": 239.313,
          "en": "in the head section of your HTML document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 240.27,
          "end": 242.88,
          "en": "Because you might notice that this skeleton",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 242.88,
          "end": 245.01,
          "en": "does not justify define the marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 245.01,
          "end": 247.92,
          "en": "where the actual page content will be injected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 247.92,
          "end": 250.38,
          "en": "but also some other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 250.38,
          "end": 253.92,
          "en": "These are some utility components for getting live reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 253.92,
          "end": 258.42,
          "en": "during development for restoring the scroll bar position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 258.42,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "if users navigate between pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 264,
          "en": "and for injecting the client side scripts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 264,
          "end": 266.64300000000003,
          "en": "when the page is downloaded on the client side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 267.81,
          "end": 270.51,
          "en": "But we also got these components in the head section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 270.51,
          "end": 273.6,
          "en": "which are used by Remix to inject any metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 273.6,
          "end": 276.87,
          "en": "or any links that apply to pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 276.87,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "And with links, I mean link elements like this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 282.15,
          "en": "That's how we could point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 282.15,
          "end": 285.57,
          "en": "at a style sheet in a regular HTML document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 285.57,
          "end": 287.58,
          "en": "And instead of adding link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 287.58,
          "end": 291.09000000000003,
          "en": "we add our links with that links function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.09000000000003,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "This function, if you add it, should return an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 298.08,
          "en": "And in that array you have various objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 298.08,
          "end": 301.44,
          "en": "where every object defines one link that will be injected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 301.44,
          "end": 303.9,
          "en": "in this links place here by a Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.9,
          "end": 305.553,
          "en": "when it renders your page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 306.48,
          "end": 308.97,
          "en": "Here you add all the attributes you would add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 308.97,
          "end": 313.97,
          "en": "on this link element as properties in this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 313.98,
          "end": 317.74,
          "en": "So here I add the rel property and set it to style sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 318.63,
          "end": 320.88,
          "en": "as I would've added the rel attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 320.88,
          "end": 322.973,
          "en": "with a value of style sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 322.973,
          "end": 327.783,
          "en": "to the link element I could have added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 329.49,
          "end": 332.15999999999997,
          "en": "And then I add another property called href,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 332.15999999999997,
          "end": 334.89300000000003,
          "en": "which points at the style sheet that should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 335.73,
          "end": 337.47,
          "en": "Now here's a special twist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 337.47,
          "end": 340.08,
          "en": "You do actually import your style sheets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 340.08,
          "end": 342.57,
          "en": "into your JavaScript files like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 342.57,
          "end": 344.88,
          "en": "You add a new import statement in your file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 344.88,
          "end": 346.8,
          "en": "where you wanna import it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 346.8,
          "end": 349.83,
          "en": "then you give it any name of your choice like styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 349.83,
          "end": 353.55,
          "en": "and then you point at the file that should be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 353.55,
          "end": 355.707,
          "en": "Here we can point at /styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 355.707,
          "end": 360.03,
          "en": "./styles to be precise, to create a relative path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 360.03,
          "end": 362.133,
          "en": "And then main.css.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 363.3,
          "end": 366.36,
          "en": "By the way, you can also use the tilde symbol here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 366.36,
          "end": 367.8,
          "en": "That's a special alias",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 367.8,
          "end": 369.78,
          "en": "which you can use in your import statements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 369.78,
          "end": 372.51,
          "en": "And it will always refer to your app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 372.51,
          "end": 375.57,
          "en": "So this is looking for a styles folder in your app folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 375.57,
          "end": 377.64300000000003,
          "en": "which is a folder that exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 378.69,
          "end": 381.87,
          "en": "So this will import my styles, and now it's these styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 381.87,
          "end": 384.45,
          "en": "which we use as a value for href here.",
          "zh": ""
